  'vol':     ('Volatility event — watches for a fast vol spike (VIX term-structure inversion, put/call, dealer gamma). DISPLAY-ONLY: deep options-flow history is not freely available, so this leg accrues forward and self-validates — do not trade it on its own yet.',
              '波动率事件——监测快速波动率飙升（VIX期限结构倒挂、认沽/认购、做市商Gamma）。仅展示：深度期权流历史无法免费获取，故该因子前向累积并自我验证——暂不单独据此交易。'),
} -%}
{%- set st = {
