               '当前观察（最早活跃层）——微弱迹象；高召回低精度。留意即可，暂不单独据此行动。'),
  'caution':  ('Right now CAUTION — multiple legs firing and pressure building, but the broad tape is still intact.',
               '当前警惕——多个因子触发、压力上升，但大盘尚未破位。'),
  'elevated': ('Right now ELEVATED (loud tier) — this fires only when the broad market is also breaking. Trim gross and raise hedges.',
               '当前升高（响亮层）——仅在大盘同步破位时触发。降低总仓位并增加对冲。'),
  'risk-off': ('Right now RISK-OFF (loudest) — a conjunction of confirmed legs; defensive sizing is warranted. De-risk means a smaller book, not a different one.',
               '当前避险（最响）——多因子共振确认；应采取防御性仓位。去风险是减小仓位，而非更换持仓。'),
} -%}
{%- set b = base.get(scare, ('', '')) -%}
{%- set s = st.get(band, st['calm']) -%}
{{ t(b[0], b[1]) }}<br><br>{{ t(s[0], s[1]) }}
