    <details class="howto">
      <summary>{{ t('New here? How to read this page in 60 seconds', '初次访问？60 秒读懂本页') }}</summary>
      <div>
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>1.</b> The colored badge is the market regime — the "weather" (not a calendar quarter!). The second badge is the transition radar — whether that weather is about to change.<br>
        <b>2.</b> Right under the regime is <b>how to trade it</b> — a posture dial (defensive → aggressive) with the conditions behind it, how far along this regime is, and a hover for the historical odds of what comes next.<br>
        <b>3.</b> Everything below that is supporting evidence. Hover any <span class="help">?</span> for a plain-English explanation. <span class="pos">Green = risk-friendly</span>, <span class="neg">red = risk-hostile</span>.<br>
        <b>4.</b> This is a context machine with measured odds, not a crystal ball.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>1.</b> 彩色徽章是市场周期 — 即"天气"（不是日历季度！）。第二个徽章是转换雷达 — 这种天气是否即将改变。<br>
        <b>2.</b> 周期正下方是<b>如何交易</b> — 一个持仓刻度盘（防御 → 激进）及其背后的条件、当前周期已走多远，并可悬停查看接下来各路径的历史概率。<br>
        <b>3.</b> 其下的所有内容都是佐证。将鼠标悬停在任意 <span class="help">?</span> 上可获得通俗解释。<span class="pos">绿色 = 风险友好</span>，<span class="neg">红色 = 风险敌对</span>。<br>
        <b>4.</b> 这是一台带有量化概率的背景分析机器，而非水晶球。
        </span>
