      <span class="l-en">Policy-Lever Conditions</span><span class="l-zh">政策杠杆条件监测</span>
      {{ help("Conditions that make violent overnight reversals more likely — not a forecast, not a signal. ARMED = semis drawdown deep (≤−15%) AND an oil technical curl; ELEVATED = one of the two; QUIET = neither. Display-only context (Policy-Shock W2-F). Drawdown and arming are descriptive; no probabilities.", "使剧烈隔夜反转更可能发生的条件 — 不是预测，不是信号。触发=半导体回撤深（≤−15%）且石油技术卷曲；警戒=两者之一；平静=均无。仅供展示（政策冲击 W2-F）。回撤和触发均为描述性指标，不含概率。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if PL.get('framing') %}
