          {{ help("Equal-weight z-mean of qualifying market indicators (legs), each oriented so a positive z-score points toward greed. Display-only context — not a signal, not a timed call, never scored. Young series (putcall, AAII) are shown separately.","合格市场指标（分量）的等权 z 均值，每项方向均以正 z 为贪婪。仅供展示参考 — 非信号，非择时判断，不计分。过短序列（看跌/看涨比、AAII）单独展示。") }}
        </h3>
        <div style="background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px">
