              <td class="muted">{{ td(r.sector) }}</td>
              <td class="r {{ 'az-up' if r.alpha and r.alpha > 0 else 'az-dn' }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.alpha) }}</td>
              <td class="r muted">{% if r.sector_rank %}#{{ r.sector_rank }}/{{ r.sector_n }}{% endif %}</td>
              <td>{% set sg = r.signal if (r.signal is defined) else none %}{% if sg and sg.tier_cascade == 'T1' %}<span class="ts-buy ok" data-tip-en="Confirmed: 2D MACD-RSI × 3D StochRSI crossed within ~6 days, still constructive" data-tip-zh="已确认：2日MACD-RSI×3日StochRSI约近6日内交叉、仍具建设性">{{ t('Buy zone', '买入区') }}</span>{% elif sg and sg.tier_cascade == 'T2' %}<span class="ts-buy ok" data-tip-en="Confirmed early tier (T2) — completed-bar cross that typically fills nearer the trough than the master signal." data-tip-zh="T2已确认的提前层——基于已完成K线的交叉，成交价通常比主信号更贴近低点。"><span class="l-en">Early buy</span><span class="l-zh">提前买点</span></span>{% elif sg and sg.tier_cascade == 'T3' %}<span class="ts-buy soon" data-tip-en="Anticipation: 3D StochRSI crossed, 2D MACD-RSI about to cross (next 1-2 bars){% if sg.provisional %}. PROVISIONAL — projected off the incomplete 2D bucket; a measured 23.8% of US T3 fresh fires repaint when it completes (calibration/provisional_replay.json, W6 #22){% endif %}" data-tip-zh="预期：3日StochRSI已上穿、2日MACD-RSI即将交叉（未来1-2根K线）{% if sg.provisional %}。暂定 — 基于未完成的2日K线桶，桶完成后实测23.8%的美股T3新信号会重绘{% endif %}">{{ t('About to cross', '即将交叉') }}</span>{% if sg.provisional %}<span class="prov-flag" data-tip-en="Provisional — may repaint. Measured: 23.8% of US T3 fresh fires (41/172) vanish within 4 sessions of the 2D bucket completing (calibration/provisional_replay.json, W6 #22)." data-tip-zh="暂定 — 可能重绘：实测美股23.8%（41/172）的T3新信号在K线桶完成后4个交易日内消失。"><span class="l-en">prov</span><span class="l-zh">暂定</span></span>{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td>{% if r.label %}{{ td(r.label) }}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td>{% if r.alpha_entry == 'pullback' %}<span class="ent-good">{{ t('pullback', '回调') }}</span>{% elif r.alpha_entry == 'extended' %}<span class="ent-warn">{{ t('extended', '过热') }}</span>{% else %}<span class="muted">{{ r.alpha_entry or '—' }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="r {{ 'az-up' if r.factor_z and r.factor_z > 0 else ('az-dn' if r.factor_z and r.factor_z < 0 else 'muted') }}">{% if r.factor_z is not none %}{{ '%+.1f'|format(r.factor_z) }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
              <td class="r"><b>{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.setup) }}</b></td>
            </tr>
          {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {% else %}
        <p class="ts-empty">⚪ {{ t("No names have a fresh MACD-2D × StochRSI-3D confluence buy right now — so there are no actionable setups to recommend today. A strong α leader that is downtrending or topped on the 3D MACD/StochRSI is not a buy; this board only lists names that have actually triggered the entry. See Top Picks for the full conviction board.", "当前没有标的触发新的 MACD-2D × StochRSI-3D 共振买入 — 因此今日没有可推荐的可操作布局。在 3日 MACD/StochRSI 上下行或做顶的强势 α 领涨股不构成买入；本榜单只列出确实已触发入场的标的。完整信念榜见精选股。") }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px; margin-top:8px">⚠ {{ t("Cycle-timing signals are about <i>where in the price cycle</i> a sector is — most useful combined with the regime read above. Our calibration shows these states don't beat buy-and-hold on average return; their value is structure and risk placement (entry + a defined exit), not certainty.", "周期择时信号关乎一个板块<i>处于价格周期的哪个位置</i> — 与上方的周期判读结合使用最有价值。我们的校准显示这些状态在平均回报上并不能跑赢买入持有；它们的价值在于结构与风险摆位（入场 + 明确的出场），而非确定性。") }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
