      </table>
      *measured per state across the 11 sector ETFs. The OVERSOLD BOUNCE row's headline is its ABSOLUTE
      return (the dip bounces); its vs-SPY is shown beside it because a low-beta defensive tends to lag a
      rising index — a tactical mean-reversion trade, never a confirmed buy. Honest ceiling: hit-rates ~50-56% — the edge
      is in magnitude and in AVOIDANCE (it stops you chasing the "confirmed leadership" that
